cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Burmese Handwritten Sentence Dataset (BHSD), please cite it using the information below."
type: dataset
title: "Burmese Handwritten Sentence Dataset (BHSD)"
authors:
  - family-names: "Oo"
    given-names: "Ah Maung"
  - name: "DatarrX"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-08-29
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/Drew2456/Burmese-Handwritten-Sentence-Dataset"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  An open sentence-level Burmese handwriting dataset containing 2,850 images
  from 54 unique volunteer writers. The release includes 2,700 core images
  across natural, rare, and nonce categories, together with 150 supplementary
  coverage images contributed by 10 members of the original writer group.
keywords:
  - Burmese
  - Myanmar script
  - handwriting recognition
  - optical character recognition
  - handwritten text recognition
  - low-resource language

